OL,3,GNEWSATax revenue from big companies
OL,4,Aprojected to double
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials are expecting to collect
OL,7,Falmost double the revenue than
OL,8,Fpreviously projected from new taxes on
OL,9,Fbig companies.
OL,11,FDeputy Charles Parkinson, treasury lead
OL,12,Fat the States of Guernsey, said it
OL,13,Fexpected to receive about #79m from
OL,14,FPillar Two tax revenue rather than
OL,15,F#40m.
OL,17,FPillar Two, which came into force in
OL,18,F2025, was designed to ensure the
OL,19,Flargest multinational companies paid at
OL,20,Fleast 15% tax on profits, in line with
OL,21,FOECD global tax reforms.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
